<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay reserves fell to $1.015 at Sept 13.</title>
<headline>Paraguay reserves fell to $1.015 at Sept 13.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's foreign reserves fell to $1.015 billion at Sept 13 from $1.066 billion at the end of August, Central Bank officials said Friday.</p>
<p>The decline is due to foreign debt payments and foreign exchange transactions in banks, the officials said.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion newsroom, (59521) 444527</p>
